{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"综合能源","country":"吉布提","country_iso":"DJI","created_at":"2026-04-10T09:30:08.030781","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"DJI-HB-0002","ldc":"Yes","location":"吉布提","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"吉布提50MW双燃料电厂及输变电工程咨询项目","project_name_en":"Djibouti 50MW Dual-Fuel Power Plant and Transmission & Distribution Project Consultancy","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"中能建","content":"9月4日，电规总院公司中标中国进出口银行吉布提国家电网及发电建设咨询项目。这是电规总院首次参与并中标的金融机构国际综合咨询项目。\n该项目包括新建50兆瓦双燃料电厂以及配套的230千伏输变电工程。咨询论证服务范围包括调研吉布提电力系统现状，评价供电系统状态，论证项目建设的必要性、技术可行性、建设规模和经济的合理性。咨询服务涵盖规划、发电、电网、造价、设备状态以及运营管理水平评估等多个业务领域。\n项目投标分初步报价和正式投标两个阶段，历时4个月。电规总院公司凭借丰富的海外咨询业绩、强大的咨询团队、合理的报价以及完善的咨询实施方案，赢得一致认可，在5家投标单位中脱颖而出，顺利中标。","content_sha256":"2f0c4a14cdfad17a33fcec5ceb76e36a5179266ac8a45d7af97971ad205312a3","id":25705,"publish_date":"2018-09-07 08:26:19","title":"中能建电规总院公司中标吉布提国家电网及发电建设咨询项目","title_sha256":"049d3cc13b169fe815045f8c75e64784115296fea78b3c3e56d28f047bade664","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/2229.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"DJI-HB-0002","capacity_details":"新建50兆瓦双燃料电厂","capacity_mw":50.0,"capacity_mw_raw":"50","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-04-10T09:30:08.032186","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"DJI-HB-0002-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[\"https://www.yidaiyilu.gov.cn/p/04JT2JK8.html\"]","official_website_links":"[]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"吉布提国家电网","project_developer_en":"Djibouti National Electric Grid","project_stage":"中标","project_summary":"电规总院公司中标吉布提国家电网及发电建设咨询项目。该项目